No video has gone up.

00:13:58.700 --> 00:14:03.660
I'm sure they know they'd be admitting
to the crime if they posted one.

00:14:03.660 --> 00:14:10.250
Instead, the video your client posted
already has over 500,000 views.

00:14:10.250 --> 00:14:14.330
The comments are going crazy with
criticism for ToDaBaShi Destroyer Z.

00:14:14.330 --> 00:14:16.160
Oh, wait a second.

00:14:16.160 --> 00:14:18.660
--What's up?
--The ToDaBaShi guys uploaded a video.

00:14:18.660 --> 00:14:19.410
"We Turned Onion Whore's Fate into a Rap!!"

00:14:18.660 --> 00:14:19.410
--The ToDaBaShi guys uploaded a video.

00:14:20.160 --> 00:14:22.410
♬ Onion Whore, serves you right! ♬

00:14:22.410 --> 00:14:23.450
♬ Serves you right! ♬

00:14:23.450 --> 00:14:25.410
♬ You know, you reap... ♬

00:14:25.410 --> 00:14:26.410
♬ ...what you sow! ♬

00:14:26.410 --> 00:14:30.700
♬ First your car, then it's your turn. ♬

00:14:30.700 --> 00:14:34.250
♬ Then it's your turn! ♬

00:14:34.250 --> 00:14:39.120
They don't actually say it was their doing,
but the comments keep on coming.

00:14:39.120 --> 00:14:40.370
"But who trashed the car, anyway?"

00:14:40.370 --> 00:14:43.370
"Are they gonna settle this beef?"

00:14:40.370 --> 00:14:43.370
Aha, so that's it.

00:14:43.370 --> 00:14:44.870
What do you mean?

00:14:44.870 --> 00:14:47.160
No, it's just speculation on my part.

00:14:47.160 --> 00:14:50.750
You should see what info
you can get from that Saitou guy.

00:14:52.080 --> 00:14:54.000
The comments are 50/50.

00:14:54.000 --> 00:14:57.370
Some support us, and some support ToDaBaShi.

00:14:57.370 --> 00:14:58.950
They both have tons and tons of views.

00:14:58.950 --> 00:14:59.870
--You don't have much to say today.
But yesterday, you did.

00:14:59.870 --> 00:15:02.040
--Let's shoot the next video soon!
--You don't have much to say today.
But yesterday, you did.

00:15:02.040 --> 00:15:04.330
--We'll win over online public opinion!
--You don't have much to say today.
But yesterday, you did.

00:15:04.330 --> 00:15:07.620
--What to do for the next video...
--If there's something
you want to say, I'll listen.

00:15:07.620 --> 00:15:10.120
Come by West Gate Park later.

00:15:14.040 --> 00:15:18.370
The studio is downsizing, and I'm out.

00:15:18.370 --> 00:15:20.370
I was told suddenly last night.

00:15:20.370 --> 00:15:23.790
It's not like I messed up
or had a fight with them.

00:15:23.790 --> 00:15:26.040
They say they're just cutting back on expenses.

00:15:26.040 --> 00:15:29.290
But doesn't Ryuusei make quite a bit of money?

00:15:29.290 --> 00:15:33.500
The lower pay rate for videos
is slowly catching up.

00:15:33.500 --> 00:15:36.540
Money's pretty tight for the studio.

00:15:36.540 --> 00:15:38.580
Come on.

00:15:38.580 --> 00:15:41.370
If you've got more to say, why not say it?

00:15:41.370 --> 00:15:45.910
You won't be involved
with Ryuusei anymore, right?

00:15:45.910 --> 00:15:49.580
The quarrel between Ryuusei-san
and ToDaBaShi Destroyer Z is...

00:15:49.580 --> 00:15:50.830
...pro wrestling!

00:15:50.830 --> 00:15:53.160
Huh?

00:15:53.160 --> 00:15:58.000
They arranged it in advance, and now
they're using illegal moves on each other!

00:15:58.000 --> 00:16:01.450
Ryuusei-san is the babyface,
and ToDaBaShi is the heel!

00:16:01.450 --> 00:16:07.200
Ryuusei-san allied with the ToDaBaShi guys
to stir people up and improve business!

00:16:07.200 --> 00:16:09.790
So they were in league behind the scenes...

00:16:09.790 --> 00:16:13.620
They diss each other to attract
attention and more views.

00:16:13.620 --> 00:16:17.500
Ryuusei-san even agreed
to his car getting trashed!

00:16:18.910 --> 00:16:21.750
So the reason the ToDaBaShi guys
knew they were being watched

00:16:21.750 --> 00:16:24.830
is because Ryuusei contacted
them from the bathroom.

00:16:24.830 --> 00:16:25.660
That means he was using me and Takashi.

00:16:25.660 --> 00:16:28.870
"Before you're surrounded by G-Boys--"

00:16:25.660 --> 00:16:28.870
That means he was using me and Takashi.

00:16:29.370 --> 00:16:33.910
Because involving the G-Boys
would mean that much more exposure.

00:16:33.910 --> 00:16:35.500
But...

00:16:35.500 --> 00:16:41.000
Even though he has money to pay ToDaBaShi
and the G-Boys, he just up and fires me.

00:16:41.000 --> 00:16:42.700
Isn't that horrible?

00:16:50.250 --> 00:16:53.500
What'd you call me out here for?

00:16:55.370 --> 00:16:58.540
Oh, so you found out.

00:16:58.540 --> 00:17:01.790
Who'd you hear it from, Gong?

00:17:01.790 --> 00:17:05.330
You should have told us
the whole story from the start.

00:17:05.330 --> 00:17:09.500
Then, we could have gone
about things differently.

00:17:09.500 --> 00:17:13.040
I feel bad for tricking you.

00:17:13.040 --> 00:17:16.160
You were seriously trying to protect me.

00:17:16.160 --> 00:17:21.370
Don't worry about me. Your big mistake
was manipulating Takashi.

00:17:21.370 --> 00:17:25.830
Some of his guys were hurt.
He won't just let this go.

00:17:25.830 --> 00:17:27.580
I...

00:17:29.290 --> 00:17:31.910
I never meant for anyone to get hurt!

00:17:31.910 --> 00:17:34.750
I need you to believe that!

00:17:34.750 --> 00:17:37.580
Be sure to prove to Takashi you're sincere.

00:17:37.580 --> 00:17:39.370
I'm sure you've heard the rumor

00:17:39.370 --> 00:17:44.290
that several guys who've made him mad
were never heard from again.

00:17:44.290 --> 00:17:45.540
See you.

00:17:52.870 --> 00:17:54.080
Makoto-san!

00:17:55.450 --> 00:17:56.870
A falling-out?

00:17:56.870 --> 00:18:00.200
Yes. Apparently, they argued over pay details.

00:18:00.200 --> 00:18:02.870
The ToDaBaShi guys are angry for real!

00:18:02.870 --> 00:18:05.000
This isn't another lie, is it?

00:18:05.000 --> 00:18:06.500
This time it's serious!

00:18:06.500 --> 00:18:11.160
Despite that, Ryuusei-san plans
to force tomorrow's shoot anyway.

00:18:11.160 --> 00:18:13.870
I know you're not obligated
to help us, at this point.

00:18:13.870 --> 00:18:17.870
But could you still help out
Ryuusei-san somehow?

00:18:27.870 --> 00:18:29.160
Makoto!

00:18:29.160 --> 00:18:33.540
I figured, I've come this far,
I might as well see it through to the end.

00:18:33.540 --> 00:18:37.830
I'm grateful, but things
could get a little dangerous.

00:18:37.830 --> 00:18:41.080
The truth is, there's serious trouble
between me and ToDaBaShi.

00:18:41.080 --> 00:18:45.200
Fine by me. I'm used to that stuff.

00:18:45.200 --> 00:18:48.200
Okay! Five years, here we come!

00:18:49.660 --> 00:18:51.580
That's really darn tall...

00:18:51.580 --> 00:18:53.330
Are you sure you'll be okay?

00:18:53.330 --> 00:18:57.080
Leave it to me. Falling down
stairs is my specialty.

00:18:57.080 --> 00:19:00.910
This hasn't been authorized, so we'll
go right up and I'll dive right down.

00:19:00.910 --> 00:19:02.790
I'll film it from below.

00:19:02.790 --> 00:19:06.200
We leave as soon as it's done.

00:19:06.200 --> 00:19:09.160
Thanks for coming.

00:19:09.160 --> 00:19:12.160
I didn't have my hopes up, so it made me happy.

00:19:12.160 --> 00:19:14.410
You should be thanking Yokoi.

00:19:14.410 --> 00:19:16.700
Now I just want to be there to see

00:19:16.700 --> 00:19:20.750
that historic cultural transformation
you talked about.

00:19:22.040 --> 00:19:23.250
Ryuusei-san!

00:19:24.410 --> 00:19:26.700
Found you, Ryuusei!

00:19:26.700 --> 00:19:28.950
We're gonna kick your ass!

00:19:28.950 --> 00:19:30.660
You think you can just use people!

00:19:30.660 --> 00:19:31.790
Stop.

00:19:50.580 --> 00:19:54.540
Hey, do you know about the Hammer Bros.?

00:19:54.540 --> 00:19:55.950
No, I don't!

00:19:55.950 --> 00:19:57.330
Oh.

00:20:08.290 --> 00:20:11.540
You hurt our people.

00:20:11.540 --> 00:20:13.040
That's enough!

00:20:13.040 --> 00:20:15.830
They're just kids!

00:20:15.830 --> 00:20:18.000
--Makoto...
--You must be Ryuusei.

00:20:18.000 --> 00:20:23.620
You owe us, too, for that trick you pulled.

00:20:23.620 --> 00:20:26.080
I'm very sorry!

00:20:26.080 --> 00:20:31.580
It was wrong! I'll do anything you want later,
just let me fall down the stairs!

00:20:31.580 --> 00:20:34.450
Hey, why not let him?

00:20:34.450 --> 00:20:37.870
He's got 1.2 million people waiting for him.

00:20:37.870 --> 00:20:40.450
Makoto...

00:20:40.450 --> 00:20:43.120
Thank you!

00:20:44.330 --> 00:20:46.000
Suit yourself.

00:20:50.330 --> 00:20:51.410
"[grateful] Fifth-Anniversary Celebration
Human Die DX!! [emotional]"

00:20:51.410 --> 00:20:54.910
"[grateful] Fifth-Anniversary Celebration
Human Die DX!! [emotional]"

00:20:51.410 --> 00:20:54.910
Let fly to the future!

00:20:54.910 --> 00:20:56.580
Ohhh...

00:20:57.580 --> 00:20:58.830
--Clack!
--Wow, I never want to do that.

00:20:58.830 --> 00:21:00.790
--Subscribe to my channel and spread the word!
--Wow, I never want to do that.

00:21:00.790 --> 00:21:03.450
--Thank you!
--Things got bad after that.

00:21:03.450 --> 00:21:06.200
Ryuusei had fractures here and there.

00:21:06.200 --> 00:21:08.450
We carried him out in a hurry and hailed a taxi,

00:21:08.450 --> 00:21:10.500
and he went straight to the hospital.

00:21:10.500 --> 00:21:14.580
What did the G-Boys King
do about punishing Ryuusei?

00:21:14.580 --> 00:21:19.250
He made him pay in full for the bodyguard
service, and then he forgave him.

00:21:19.250 --> 00:21:24.370
I hear he also got the right to use
Ryuusei's studio anytime he likes.

00:21:24.370 --> 00:21:26.290
A wise decision.

00:21:26.290 --> 00:21:28.830
Whatever the net brings about,

00:21:28.830 --> 00:21:34.160
the only way we'll survive is if we
move along with the changing times.

00:21:34.160 --> 00:21:38.830
If you've got time to complain,
you might as well upload a video or two.

00:21:38.830 --> 00:21:42.370
Don't you post any videos
yourself, Zero-One-san?

00:21:42.370 --> 00:21:45.330
You could say I'm more the type who watches.

00:21:45.330 --> 00:21:48.660
But what I want to know is, did you bring <i>it</i>?

00:21:48.660 --> 00:21:49.700
Yes.

00:21:49.700 --> 00:21:53.450
After all, you gave me
all sorts of advice this time.

00:21:53.450 --> 00:21:55.790
So, this is ramen from Nao.

00:21:55.790 --> 00:21:58.790
I've always wanted to try some.

00:21:59.870 --> 00:22:01.200
Is this okay?

00:22:01.200 --> 00:22:03.450
Zero-One is a regular here.

00:22:03.450 --> 00:22:06.250
They let him get away with a few things.

00:22:07.910 --> 00:22:11.290
Maybe I'll try posting some videos, too.

00:22:11.290 --> 00:22:12.540
Oh, I know!

00:22:12.540 --> 00:22:15.450
How about eating this ramen
with sherbet or something on top?

00:22:15.450 --> 00:22:15.830
"I Tried Downing an Onion in My Hospital Room!"

00:22:15.830 --> 00:22:17.750
"I Tried Downing an Onion in My Hospital Room!"

00:22:15.830 --> 00:22:17.750
Do that with your own.

00:22:17.750 --> 00:22:19.120
"I Tried Downing an Onion in My Hospital Room!"

00:22:17.750 --> 00:22:19.120
I knew you'd say no!

00:22:19.120 --> 00:22:19.950
"I Tried Downing an Onion in My Hospital Room!"

00:22:19.120 --> 00:22:19.950
<i>What's up</i>
I knew you'd say no!

00:22:19.950 --> 00:22:23.080
<i>A world where guys with plans</i>
<i>are the first to fade away</i>

00:22:23.080 --> 00:22:25.790
<i>The thought hit me after being out all night</i>

00:22:25.790 --> 00:22:28.620
<i>A gulf forms with the respectable types</i>

00:22:28.620 --> 00:22:31.750
<i>The MIC you nervously gripped</i>

00:22:31.750 --> 00:22:34.370
<i>Leave it behind on the stage</i>

00:22:34.370 --> 00:22:37.450
<i>Unable to trust in the next move</i>

00:22:37.450 --> 00:22:40.410
<i>You get down off the stage of dreams</i>

00:22:40.410 --> 00:22:43.200
<i>Fade away from the bustle of the scene</i>

00:22:43.200 --> 00:22:46.120
<i>Do you know what becomes of him after that?</i>

00:22:46.120 --> 00:22:49.250
<i>In fact, are you even prepared to know?</i>

00:22:49.250 --> 00:22:52.000
<i>Now that we're involved,</i>
<i>I want to watch you take off</i>

00:22:52.000 --> 00:22:54.750
<i>From the runway you chose</i>

00:22:54.750 --> 00:22:58.750
<i>If we happen to meet again today or tomorrow</i>

00:22:58.750 --> 00:23:02.410
<i>Somewhere on this Earth</i>

00:23:02.410 --> 00:23:03.870
<i>Let's have fun freestyling</i>

00:23:03.870 --> 00:23:06.950
<i>Like we did that time</i>

00:23:08.790 --> 00:23:09.620
<i>What's up</i>

00:23:09.620 --> 00:23:11.120
<i>After the live show</i>

00:23:11.120 --> 00:23:12.620
<i>In a train window</i>

00:23:12.620 --> 00:23:14.000
<i>A brother's face, I find</i>

00:23:14.000 --> 00:23:15.500
<i>Comes suddenly to mind</i>

00:23:15.500 --> 00:23:18.500
<i>Right now, I don't feel like</i>
<i>lookin' back on the past</i>

00:23:18.500 --> 00:23:21.370
<i>But no way in hell am I forgettin' it</i>

